Subject: [PATCH] Optimize empty passengers check


diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/entity/Entity.java b/net/minecraft/world/entity/Entity.java
index 20d49e4cf68b5e206bd853357259ec51c8243856..18af545d910909f42998a2ea50556e2cc83e9fa5 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/world/entity/Entity.java
